### JSON으로 보내기
POST http://localhost:4009/peek
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "제주 바다"
}

### 파일을 담아 보내기
POST http://localhost:4009/peek
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=photo-boundary

--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

제주 바다
--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./hello.txt
--photo-boundary--